Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
For I=0 To 30 : Ink I mod 8 : Circle 160,100,I*3 : Next I
Ink 1 : Text 100,190,"COMPACT"
Spack 0 To 10 : Print #1,Length(10)>0;Length(10)<32000
Pack 0 To 11,0,0,160,100 : Print #1,Length(11)>0
Cls 0 : Unpack 10 To 0
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Unpack 11,0,0
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact_2.iff"
